sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (phone)
    participant M as Miniapp (webview)
    participant B as Backend (VPS :8788)
    participant C as copilot CLI (pty, same box)
    participant P as GitHub

    Note over B,C: FUTURE — requires Copilot CLI in the image<br/>+ a provider entry in server.js

    U->>M: tap "Connect Copilot"
    M->>B: POST /api/auth/copilot/start
    B->>C: spawn copilot login (GitHub device flow)
    C-->>B: prints user-code + github.com/login/device
    B-->>M: state=awaiting_approval + code + link
    M->>P: open github.com/login/device in webview
    Note over M: webview can PRE-FILL the code field —<br/>user just taps Continue + Authorize
    U->>P: approve
    loop until approved
        C->>P: poll device-token endpoint
    end
    P-->>C: access token granted
    C-->>B: exit 0 → probe login status OK
    B-->>M: state=success
    M-->>U: Copilot connected ✓
